    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Situational Mastery</h2><p><em>Every fight begins with a choice.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>At the start of each combat, choose one: reroll the lowest die on your first attack roll, reroll the lowest die on your first defense checks, or +2 squares movement until the end of your first turn.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ First round: your first attack roll or defense check rerolls the lowest die; the movement pick is by hand.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
